# Re-record demo.gif:  brew install vhs && vhs demo.tape
Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 520
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "staleguard --version" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "git clone -q --depth 1 https://github.com/trpc/trpc && cd trpc" Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "staleguard check" Enter
Sleep 6s
